# State management

- Global state only in Redux Toolkit slices. No Zustand, MobX, Jotai, Recoil, Valtio or context for app data.
- Two slices:
  - `posts` in `entities/post/model/postsSlice.ts`;
  - `favorites` (`ids: number[]`) in `features/toggle-favorite/model/favoritesSlice.ts`.
- `posts` state: adapter `ids` and `entities`, `detailsById`, `listRequest`, `detailsRequestById`; `RequestState` is `idle`, `loading`, `succeeded`, `failed` with `error`.
- `Post`, `PostDetails` and `FavoritesState` are `z.infer` of the schemas in the `model/schemas.ts` files.
- One `persistReducer` per slice:
  - posts: whitelist `POSTS_PERSIST_KEYS` = `persistedPostsSchema.keyof().options` = `ids`, `entities`, `detailsById`;
  - favorites: the whole slice.
- Request states are never persisted.
- Every persist config has `timeout: 0`, so an empty store cannot request the network before `REHYDRATE`, plus `version: 1` and `createValidatedMigrate(schema)`: `createMigrate({})`, then `schema.safeParse`; invalid storage resolves `undefined` and the slice starts empty.
- A persisted shape change bumps the version, adds a migration and updates the schema together.
- The store is created inside `StoreProvider` through `useState(createPersistedStore)`, never at module level.
- `PersistGate` with `Loader` wraps everything that reads data or dispatches thunks.
- `serializableCheck` ignores `FLUSH`, `REHYDRATE`, `PAUSE`, `PERSIST`, `PURGE`, `REGISTER`.
- `RootState` and `AppDispatch` are global types from `src/app/state/types.ts`; exported reducers are annotated `Reducer<XState>` to avoid circular types.
- Use `useAppDispatch`, `useAppSelector`, `createAppAsyncThunk` from `@shared/lib/redux`; raw react-redux hooks only there.
- Reducers are pure: no Faker, time or randomness. Actions are past-tense events (`favoriteToggled`).

Checks:
- `tsc` for the state shape and global types (enabled).
- ESLint `no-restricted-imports` (other state libraries, AsyncStorage, raw hooks, MMKV outside storage, zod outside `api`, `model` and `app/state`), `no-restricted-syntax` for top-level `configureStore` and `persistStore`, `check:deps` (enabled).

Full guide: @docs/ai/guidelines/state-management.md
